Upstream provenance
-------------------

This project is an independent Rust translation of selected components
of GNU R (https://www.r-project.org), Copyright (C) The R Foundation for
Statistical Computing / The R Core Team. GNU R is licensed under
GPL-2.0-or-later, and this port keeps that license accordingly.

The vendored upstream C source used as the diff-and-verify reference is
not part of the crate build and is not distributed in this repository;
it can be reproduced exactly from the pinned commit with:

    ./scripts/fetch-r-source.sh

That tree retains the R Core Team copyright and its original licensing.
See README.md ("License and provenance") for details.

